OL,3,GNEWSAHull conference to discuss
OL,4,Atraining space workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FHull College is hosting a conference on
OL,7,Ftraining people for the space industry.
OL,9,FThe event on 8 October will "bring
OL,10,Ftogether leaders from industry,
OL,11,Feducation and the space sector,"
OL,12,Faccording to a college spokesperson.
OL,14,FSpeakers will talk about the skills the
OL,15,Fsector will need over the next five to
OL,16,F10 years, with a focus how to develop a
OL,17,Fmore diverse workforce.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
