OL,3,GNEWSAHull conference to discuss
OL,4,Atraining space workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FHull College principal Debra Gray said:
OL,7,F"When people hear 'space', they still
OL,8,Ftend to think of astronauts, scientists
OL,9,Fand rockets. But there is a much bigger
OL,10,Fworkforce beneath that ` the people who
OL,11,Fwill build, operate, maintain and
OL,12,Fsupport the technology and
OL,13,Finfrastructure the sector needs."
